  ┄┄ what it takes to keep a team's access correct ┄┄
  team of 5, 20 subnames per registry, 3 registries the team manages:
    per-subname grants            5 × 20 × 3 = 300 grants; every new subname needs 5 more
    root grants on each registry  5 × 3 = 15 grants; each join/leave touches all 3 registries
    cascade                       5 memberships + 3 parent grants = 8; each join/leave is 1 tx
  root grants already cover future subnames — what Cascade adds is one roster shared by every registry.

  scope: one hop only — a deeper tree needs a CascadeSubregistry, with its own team and parent, at each level that should inherit.

